## lib/IO.stk — `use Polars::IO`
##
## pandas IO surface: `pd_read_csv`, `pd_read_parquet`, `pd_read_json`,
## `pd_read_sql`, `pd_read_feather`, `pd_to_csv`, `pd_to_parquet`,
## `pd_to_json`, … (~30 fns target).
##
## Parquet / Arrow IO routes through `stryke-arrow` to share a single
## arrow-rs link in-process; stryke-polars does not link arrow-rs directly
## to avoid dlsym conflicts.
##
## Phase status: scaffold only.

package Polars::IO

use Polars

